{"sha": "fe52bab0c7bddaca83eb9aa56c3e6a7edb7edaa7532eb3bbff8ad48ed282af7a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:vectors} 章 --- 向量}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:1}", "$\\vect{AB} + \\vect{BD} = \\vect{AD}$（沙勒关系）。", "", "$\\vect{KL} + \\vect{LM} + \\vect{MK} = \\vect{KK} = \\vec 0$.", "", "$\\vect{AC} - \\vect{BC} = \\vect{AC} + \\vect{CB} = \\vect{AB}$.", "", "$\\vect{AB} + \\vect{CA} = \\vect{CA} + \\vect{AB} = \\vect{CB}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:2}", "$\\vect{AB}\\,(5-2,\\ 3-1) = (3, 2)$; \\quad", "$\\vect{BC}\\,(-1-5,\\ 4-3) = (-6, 1)$; \\quad", "$\\vect{AC}\\,(-1-2,\\ 4-1) = (-3, 3)$.", "验算：$(3, 2) + (-6, 1) = (-3, 3)$，按坐标逐一相加。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:3}", "$\\vec u + \\vec v = (2 + (-1),\\ -3 + 4) = (1, 1)$.", "", "$3\\vec u = (6, -9)$.", "", "$2\\vec u - \\vec v = (4 - (-1),\\ -6 - 4) = (5, -10)$.", "", "$\\norm{\\vec u} = \\sqrt{2^2 + (-3)^2} = \\sqrt{13}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:4}", "(a) $4 \\times 9 - 6 \\times 6 = 36 - 36 = 0$：共线", "($\\vec v = \\frac32 \\vec u$).", "", "(b) $2 \\times 10 - (-5) \\times (-4) = 20 - 20 = 0$：共线", "($\\vec v = -2\\vec u$).", "", "(c) $3 \\times 3 - 1 \\times 1 = 8 \\neq 0$：不共线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:5}", "$\\vect{AB}\\,(4, -2)$，$\\vect{DC}\\,(6 - x_D,\\ 3 - y_D)$。条件", "$\\vect{AB} = \\vect{DC}$ 给出 $6 - x_D = 4$ 且 $3 - y_D = -2$，于是", "$D(2, 5)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:6}", "\\emph{1.} $\\vect{AB}\\,(3, 2)$ 与 $\\vect{AC}\\,(6, -2)$，于是", "$\\vect{AB} + \\vect{AC} = (9, 0)$，且", "$M = (-2 + 9,\\ 1 + 0) = (7, 1)$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 由平行四边形法则，$\\vect{AM} = \\vect{AB} + \\vect{AC}$", "表示 $ABMC$ 是平行四边形（$M$ 为与", "$A$ 相对的第四个顶点）。可以验证：$\\vect{AB}\\,(3,2)$ 与 $\\vect{CM}\\,(7-4,\\ 1-(-1)) =", "(3, 2)$ 相等。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:7}", "第一组：$\\vect{AB}\\,(3, 2)$，$\\vect{AC}\\,(9, 6)$；", "$3 \\times 6 - 2 \\times 9 = 0$：共线（$\\vect{AC} = 3\\vect{AB}$）。", "", "第二组：$\\vect{AB}\\,(2, -1)$，$\\vect{AC}\\,(8, -4)$；", "$2 \\times (-4) - (-1) \\times 8 = -8 + 8 = 0$：同样共线", "($\\vect{AC} = 4\\vect{AB}$).", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:8}", "$\\vect{AB}\\,(4, 2)$ 与 $\\vect{DC}\\,(6-2,\\ 1-(-1)) = (4, 2)$：两个", "向量\\emph{相等}，因此 $ABCD$ 是平行四边形，特别地", "$(AB) \\parallel (CD)$。平行四边形的性质是较强的那个：它", "蕴含平行（即向量共线），反之不成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:9}", "\\emph{1.} $\\vect{AB}\\,(6, 3)$，于是", "$\\vect{AI} = \\frac23\\vect{AB} = (4, 2)$，故 $I(4, 2)$。", "", "\\emph{2.} $\\vect{CB}\\,(6-2,\\ 3-5) = (4, -2)$，于是", "$\\vect{CJ} = \\frac23\\vect{CB} = \\left(\\frac83, -\\frac43\\right)$，故", "$J\\left(2 + \\frac83,\\ 5 - \\frac43\\right) = \\left(\\frac{14}{3},", "\\frac{11}{3}\\right)$.", "", "\\emph{3.} $\\vect{IJ}\\,\\left(\\frac{14}{3} - 4,\\ \\frac{11}{3} - 2\\right) =", "\\left(\\frac23, \\frac53\\right)$ 与 $\\vect{AC}\\,(2, 5)$。共线判别", "准则：", "\\[", "\\frac23 \\times 5 - \\frac53 \\times 2 = \\frac{10}{3} - \\frac{10}{3} = 0 :", "\\]", "向量共线，故 $(IJ)$ 与 $(AC)$ 平行。（$I$ 与", "$J$ 都在所在边朝 $B$ 方向的三分之一处：小", "三角形 $IBJ$ 是 $ABC$ 的缩小图形。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:vectors:10}", "各中点分别为", "\\[", "I\\left(\\tfrac{x_A + x_B}{2}, \\tfrac{y_A + y_B}{2}\\right), \\quad", "J\\left(\\tfrac{x_B + x_C}{2}, \\tfrac{y_B + y_C}{2}\\right), \\quad", "K\\left(\\tfrac{x_C + x_D}{2}, \\tfrac{y_C + y_D}{2}\\right), \\quad", "L\\left(\\tfrac{x_D + x_A}{2}, \\tfrac{y_D + y_A}{2}\\right).", "\\]", "两个向量的横坐标：", "\\[", "x_J - x_I = \\frac{x_B + x_C}{2} - \\frac{x_A + x_B}{2}", "= \\frac{x_C - x_A}{2},", "\\qquad", "x_K - x_L = \\frac{x_C + x_D}{2} - \\frac{x_D + x_A}{2}", "= \\frac{x_C - x_A}{2},", "\\]", "对纵坐标同理可得。于是", "$\\vect{IJ} = \\vect{LK}$（二者均等于 $\\frac12\\vect{AC}$），且 $IJKL$ 是", "平行四边形，无论四边形 $ABCD$ 形状如何。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}